_4238-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7993\" data-link=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/?attachment_id=7993\" class=\"wp-image-7993\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/12\/IMG_4238-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/12\/IMG_4238-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/12\/IMG_4238-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/12\/IMG_4238-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/12\/IMG_4238-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/12\/IMG_4238-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/12\/IMG_4280-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7995\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/12\/IMG_4280-scaled.jpg\" data-link=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/?attachment_id=7995\" class=\"wp-image-7995\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/12\/IMG_4280-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/12\/IMG_4280-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/12\/IMG_4280-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/12\/IMG_4280-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/12\/IMG_4280-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/12\/IMG_4280-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The purpose of giving these researchers in the field of mathematical science a platform is to enable them to connect, network, and exchange their work with others in different fields.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Prof. Wunderlich emphasized how the COVID-19 pandemic affected the planning of in-person gatherings and recognized the value of holding conferences on-site because mathematical sciences need highly interactive participant engagement.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The CMIA in particular, improved relationships between various universities and research centers and fostered collaboration between students and researchers in the field of mathematics and its applications.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>After receiving their certificates of attendance, CMIA participants thanked the event&#8217;s organizers and funders for giving them the chance to learn more about a range of mathematical<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Within the framework of the German Research Chair Program, at the African Institute for Mathematical Sciences (AIMS) Ghana, a four-day Conference on Mathematics and Its Applications (CMIA) was held in Accra from August 29 &#8211; September 1, 2022. The German Ministry of Education and Research, the DAAD Foundation, and the Alexander von Humboldt Foundation all<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":10,"featured_media":8000,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"advgb_blocks_editor_width":"","advgb_blocks_columns_visual_guide":""},"categories":[2],"tags":[],"news_types":[32],"acf":[],"author_meta":{"display_name":"charlene","author_link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/author\/charlene\/"},"featured_img":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/09\/cmia-group-300x200.jpg","coauthors":[],"tax_additional":{"categories":{"linked":["<a href=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/category\/featured\/\" class=\"advgb-post-tax-term\">Featured<\/a>"],"unlinked":["<span class=\"advgb-post-tax-term\">Featured<\/span>"]}},"comment_count":"0","relative_dates":{"created":"Posted 3 years ago","modified":"Updated 3 years ago"},"absolute_dates":{"created":"Posted on September 7, 2022","modified":"Updated 